classify
s3 503 (transient)           transient
s3 403 (permanent)           permanent
not writable                 permanent
backend error                permanent
unknown exception            transient
unix error                   transient

with_retry (max 3)
transient                    3 attempt(s), raised HTTP 503
permanent                    1 attempt(s), raised forbidden
cancelled                    1 attempt(s), raised Retry.Cancelled
unknown exception            3 attempt(s), raised Failure("something new")

with_retry (max 3), told which member it is asking
a link that is gone          3 attempt(s), raised HTTP 502, member held
the next request of it       3 attempt(s), raised HTTP 502, member held
one lost, then answered      2 attempt(s), answered, member up
an answer that is a no       1 attempt(s), raised not found, member up
answered while held          1 attempt(s), answered, member up
a store with no link         3 attempt(s), answered, member up

with_retry, called back by whoever was waiting
a deadline                   1 attempt(s), raised Lwt_unix.Timeout, member not held against
